# Secrets. Never commit.
#  - windows/.env: STF_AUTH_SECRET + admin credentials (the real secret)
#  - any host-local .env generated by the installers
#
# NOTE: the top-level .env is the legacy single-host *template* (no secrets)
# and is tracked deliberately for docker-compose.yml.
windows/.env
peers/.env
*.env
!/.env

# Runtime artifacts
*.log
pull.log
install.log
peer-ports.json
state/
